# WHAT OMNICODE IS:
#   OmniCode is an ontological, spatial-relational language structured as
#   procedural-functional flow over object-oriented roots. Natural sentences
#   and logical notation are one language, and Metadata IS live executable code
#   that compiles directly alongside execution rather than sitting in dead text.
#
# 5-BLOCK CLAUSE PAIRING:
#   - Block 1 (METADATA = WHO & WHERE): Identity, provenance, and root site.
#   - Block 2 (OPENING  = WHAT & WHEN): Memory vessels, staged imports, timing.
#   - Block 3 (BODY     = HOW & WHY):   Procedural causal rolls & human intent.
#   - Block 4 (AUDIT    = PROOF):       Verification probes, laws, tripwires.
#   - Block 5 (CLOSING  = ACTION):      Final reconciliation & outward commit.
#
# WHY THIS MANIFEST SITS AT THE ROOT ("/") & HOW IT GROWS:
#   Every ecosystem needs an unbending constitutional root. Sitting at "/",
#   manifest.omni binds the entire Big House -- OmniCode Tracks 0-5, FaithNet,
#   and Tenebris-and-Lux -- directly under =<God>= and the Ten Commandments.
#   As the language grows into its living dictionary, VM, MillenniumOS, FNP/1
#   networking, and Cornerstone game models, downstream files trace provenance
#   and inherit moral invariants straight from this living root manifest.
#
# LIVING SYNTAX NOTE:
#   Lines in Block 1 compile into active ontological anchors grounding Blocks
#   2 through 5. Rules inside this file evolve cleanly alongside SYNTAX.md.
# ==============================================================================

